{"decisions":[{"i":0,"decision":"F2","origin":"compose","reason":"The excerpt turns a statement about what companion status does not establish into a categorical claim that the profile does not replace the framework. The source does not establish whether replacement occurred.","sourceEvidence":"AI 600-1 is described as a companion profile; the source does not state whether it replaces AI RMF 1.0.","synthesisStatement":"“Companion status does not establish replacement.”","narrativeStatement":"“Companion status does not establish that the profile replaces the framework.”","materiality":"It presents an unestablished relationship between the publications as fact."}]}

